2. Browser is redirected to SoundCloud’s auth page.
3. After login/authorization, SoundCloud redirects to `https://yourdomain.com/auth/soundcloud/callback?code=XYZ`.
4. Your server receives the `code`, exchanges it for an `access_token`, and you can now make API calls on behalf of the user.

